t de haute qualité axées sur les performances, avec une rapidité telle qu’elles peuvent même être utilisées en direct.","locale":"fr_MA"},{"value":"Character Animator permette di creare animazioni espressive basate sulla mimica di alta qualità e in modo così veloce da poter essere usato in diretta.","locale":"it_IT"},{"value":"Adobe Character Animator を使用すれば、高品質で表現力豊かなパフォーマンスベースのアニメーションをすばやく作成できます。ライブアニメーションも可能です。","locale":"ja_JP"},{"value":"Character Animator 에서는 표현력이 뛰어난 높은 품질의 고성능 애니메이션을 매우 빠른 속도로 만들어 실시간으로 사용할 수 있습니다.","locale":"ko_KR"},{"value":"O Character Animator oferece animações expressivas de alta qualidade e rápido desempenho que podem ser usadas em tempo real.","locale":"pt_BR"},{"value":"Высочайшая производительность Character Animator позволяет создавать анимацию даже в режиме реального времени.","locale":"ru_RU"},{"value":"Character Animator 支持用户快速制作富有表现力、基于表演的高质量动画，以至于可以实时使用动画。","locale":"zh_CN"},{"value":"Character Animator enables expressive, high-quality performance-based animation so fast, it can even be used live.","locale":"zh_TW"}]}</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_es_ES"><value>https://www.adobe.com/go/chtutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_en_GB"><value>https://www.adobe.com/go/chtutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_de_DE"><value>https://www.adobe.com/go/chtutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_fr_FR"><value>https://www.adobe.com/go/chtutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="compatibilityCheckScript"><value>var winChecks={minOSVersion:"10.0.0.14393",osArchitecture:"64",excludedOSVersion1:"10.0.0.15063",excludedOSVersion2:"10.0.0.16299"};var macChecks={minOSVersion:"10.14.1"};var localizationStringMap={cs_CZ:{OperatingSystemWin:"Windows 10 (verze 1903 nebo novější)",OperatingSystemMac:"macOS 10.14.1 nebo novější"},da_DK:{OperatingSystemWin:"Windows 10 (version 1903 eller senere)",OperatingSystemMac:"macOS 10.14.1 eller senere"},