om-entry key="tutorialsPage_es_MX"><value>https://helpx.adobe.com/es/premiere-pro/tutorials.html</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="productDetailedDescription"><value>{"Language":[{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (version 14.0) offers new collaborative workflows, Responsive Design for motion graphics and immersive, end-to-end workflows for 360/VR.","locale":"en_US"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (version 14.0) offers new collaborative workflows, Responsive Design for motion graphics and immersive, end-to-end workflows for 360/VR.","locale":"en_GB"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (version 14.0) offers new collaborative workflows, Responsive Design for motion graphics and immersive, end-to-end workflows for 360/VR.","locale":"en_AE"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (version 14.0) offers new collaborative workflows, Responsive Design for motion graphics and immersive, end-to-end workflows for 360/VR.","locale":"en_IL"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (versión 14.0) ofrece nuevos flujos de trabajo colaborativos, un diseño optimizado para gráficos dinámicos y flujos inmersivos de punto a punto para gráficos en 360 y realidad virtual.","locale":"es_ES"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (versión 14.0) ofrece nuevos flujos de trabajo colaborativos, un diseño optimizado para gráficos dinámicos y flujos inmersivos de punto a punto para gráficos en 360 y realidad virtual.","locale":"es_MX"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (Version 14.0) bietet neue Arbeitsabläufe für die Zusammenarbeit, responsives Design für Animationen und immersive End-to-End-Workflows für 360/VR.","locale":"de_DE"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (version 14.0) offre de nouveaux workflows de collaboration, une conception réactive pour les animations graphiques, ainsi que des workflows immersifs de bout en bout pour 360/VR.","locale":"fr_FR"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (version 14.0) offre de nouveaux workflows de collaboration, une conception réactive pour les animations graphiques, ainsi que des workflows immersifs de bout en bout pour 360/VR.","locale":"fr_CA"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (version 14.0) offre de nouveaux workflows de collaboration, une conception réactive pour les animations graphiques, ainsi que des workflows immersifs de bout en bout pour 360/VR.","locale":"fr_MA"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (versione 14.0) offre nuovi flussi di lavoro per ambienti collaborativi, un’interfaccia dinamica per la grafica animata e flussi di lavoro end-to-end coinvolgenti per 360/VR.","locale":"it_IT"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (バージョン 14.0) では、新しい共同作業ワークフローと、モーショングラフィックス用のレスポンシブデザイン、360 / VR 用のイマーシブなエンドツーエンドのワークフローが提供されます。","locale":"ja_JP"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020(버전 14.0)에서는 새로운 공동 작업 워크플로, 모션 그래픽을 위한 반응형 디자인, 360/VR을 위한 몰입감 있는 엔드 투 엔드 워크플로를 제공합니다.","locale":"ko_KR"},{"value":"O Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (versão 14.0) oferece novos fluxos de trabalho de colaboração, e Design responsivo para animações e fluxos de trabalho completos e interativos para 360°/VR.","locale":"pt_BR"},{"value":"Обновление Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (версия 14.0) предлагает новые функции для совместной работы, гибкий дизайн для анимационной графики и удобную полноценную среду для совместной работы над проектами 360/VR.","locale":"ru_RU"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020（14.0 版）为动态图形提供新的协作工作流程和响应式设计，以及为 360/VR 提供沉浸式端到端工作流程。","locale":"zh_CN"}]}</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_es_ES"><value>https://helpx.adobe.com/es/premiere-pro/tutorials.html</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_sk_SK"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/premiere-pro-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_nb_NO"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/premiere-pro-tutorials_no</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_hu_HU"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/premiere-pro-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_de_DE"><value>https://he