 2020 (versão 14.0) oferece novos fluxos de trabalho de colaboração, e Design responsivo para animações e fluxos de trabalho completos e interativos para 360°/VR.","locale":"pt_BR"},{"value":"Обновление Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020 (версия 14.0) предлагает новые функции для совместной работы, гибкий дизайн для анимационной графики и удобную полноценную среду для совместной работы над проектами 360/VR.","locale":"ru_RU"},{"value":"Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2020（14.0 版）为动态图形提供新的协作工作流程和响应式设计，以及为 360/VR 提供沉浸式端到端工作流程。","locale":"zh_CN"}]}</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_es_ES"><value>https://helpx.adobe.com/es/premiere-pro/tutorials.html</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_sk_SK"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/premiere-pro-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_nb_NO"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/premiere-pro-tutorials_no</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_hu_HU"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/premiere-pro-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_de_DE"><value>https://helpx.adobe.com/de/premiere-pro/tutorials.html</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_en_GB"><value>https://helpx.adobe.com/premiere-pro/tutorials.html</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_uk_UA"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/premiere-pro-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_fr_FR"><value>https://helpx.adobe.com/fr/premiere-pro/tutorials.html</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="compatibilityCheckScript"><value>var winChecks={minOSVersion:"10.0.0.14393",osArchitecture:"64",excludedOSVersion1:"10.0.0.15063",excludedOSVersion2:"10.0.0.16299"};var macChecks={minOSVersion:"10.13.0"};var localizationStringMap={cs_CZ:{OperatingSystemWin:"Windows 10 (verze 1803 nebo novější)",OperatingSystemMac:"macOS 10.13 nebo novější"},da_DK:{OperatingSystemWin:"Windows 10 (version 1803 eller nyere)",OperatingSystemMac:"macOS 10.13 eller nyere"},de_DE:{Ope